# Server-only Supabase credentials.
# Supabase dashboard → Project Settings → API (or the "Connect" screen).
#
# Use the SECRET key, not the publishable/anon key:
#   new projects:  SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY=sb_secret_...
#   older projects: SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=eyJ...
# Either variable name works; both bypass RLS and must stay server-side.
SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT-REF.supabase.co
SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY=sb_secret_your-secret-key
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=eyJ...your-legacy-service-role-key
